<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="华东师范大学">
  <data key="d0">organization</data>
  <data key="d1">The East China Normal University is a prestigious educational institution in China, specializing in various fields including education and computer science.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="计算机科学与技术学院">
  <data key="d0">organization</data>
  <data key="d1">The School of Computer Science and Technology is a department within the East China Normal University, focusing on computer science and technology education.&lt;SEP&gt;计算机科学与技术学院是论文作者邓凌峰所在学院。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8970bd8a17e748042cb5c08933e67b74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="计算机科学与技术专业">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">The major in Computer Science and Technology is an academic program offered by the School of Computer Science and Technology at East China Normal University.&lt;SEP&gt;计算机科学与技术专业是论文作者邓凌峰所学专业。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8970bd8a17e748042cb5c08933e67b74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="邓凌峰">
  <data key="d0">person</data>
  <data key="d1">Deng Lingfeng is a student at the East China Normal University, pursuing the major in Computer Science and Technology.&lt;SEP&gt;邓凌峰是论文《基于大模型的课程语料库构建与智能问答系统的研究》的作者。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8970bd8a17e748042cb5c08933e67b74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="GPT">
  <data key="d0">organization</data>
  <data key="d1">GPT refers to the Generative Pre-trained Transformer models, which are advanced language models developed by OpenAI and applied in various natural language processing tasks.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="Khan Academy">
  <data key="d0">organization</data>
  <data key="d1">Khan Academy is an online educational platform providing free educational resources and interactive learning experiences.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="Duolingo">
  <data key="d0">organization</data>
  <data key="d1">Duolingo is a language-learning platform that offers courses in various languages with gamified learning techniques.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="知乎">
  <data key="d0">organization</data>
  <data key="d1">Zhihu is a Chinese question-and-answer website where users can ask questions and share knowledge.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="CSDN">
  <data key="d0">organization</data>
  <data key="d1">CSDN is a Chinese online community for programmers and IT professionals, offering articles, tutorials, and a question-and-answer platform.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)">
  <data key="d0">organization</data>
  <data key="d1">Retrieval-Augmented Generation is a technique that combines information retrieval and natural language generation to improve the performance of language models in specific domains.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="大模型">
  <data key="d0">technology</data>
  <data key="d1">Large models refer to a class of deep learning models that are pre-trained on large-scale datasets and can be fine-tuned for specific tasks, such as natural language processing.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="课程语料库">
  <data key="d0">organization</data>
  <data key="d1">Course corpus is a collection of text data related to a specific course, which can be used for training and improving language models.&lt;SEP&gt;课程语料库是包含特定课程内容的数据库，用于训练和测试智能问答系统。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="智能问答系统">
  <data key="d0">technology</data>
  <data key="d1">An intelligent question-answering system is a software application that can understand user queries and provide relevant answers, often based on machine learning techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;智能问答系统是本研究需构建的完整系统，具备友好的用户界面和实时返回准确解答的功能。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="在线答疑">
  <data key="d0">event</data>
  <data key="d1">Online tutoring refers to the process of providing educational support to students through the internet, often in real-time or asynchronously.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="智能辅导">
  <data key="d0">event</data>
  <data key="d1">Intelligent tutoring refers to the use of artificial intelligence to provide personalized educational assistance to students, aiming to improve their learning outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="虚拟助教">
  <data key="d0">technology</data>
  <data key="d1">A virtual tutor is a computer program designed to simulate a human tutor, providing educational content and interacting with students to support their learning process.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="机器翻译">
  <data key="d0">technology</data>
  <data key="d1">Machine translation is the process of automatically translating text from one language to another using computational methods.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="教材">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">Textbooks are educational materials written to be used in schools or educational institutions to teach students about a particular subject.&lt;SEP&gt;教材是课程语料库的一部分，包含课程的基本教学材料。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="讲义">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">Lecture notes are written materials prepared by teachers to accompany their lectures, providing students with additional information and explanations.&lt;SEP&gt;讲义是课程语料库的一部分，包含教师讲解课程内容时的补充材料。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="习题">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">Exercises are problems or tasks designed to test and reinforce students' understanding of a particular subject or concept.&lt;SEP&gt;习题是课程语料库的一部分，用于检验学生对课程内容的理解。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="参考资料">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">Reference materials are additional resources that provide information or support for a particular topic or subject, often used for further study or research.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="PDF">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">PDF stands for Portable Document Format, a file format used for representing documents in a manner independent of application software, hardware, and operating systems.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="预处理技术">
  <data key="d0">technology</data>
  <data key="d1">Preprocessing techniques are methods used to prepare data for analysis or processing, such as converting PDF files to text and image data.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="信息检索">
  <data key="d0">technology</data>
  <data key="d1">Information retrieval is the process of obtaining relevant information from a large collection of data, often using search engines or database systems.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="知识图谱">
  <data key="d0">technology</data>
  <data key="d1">A knowledge graph is a structured representation of information, typically used to model real-world entities, relationships, and attributes, and is often used in applications such as semantic search and question-answering.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="微调">
  <data key="d0">technology</data>
  <data key="d1">Fine-tuning is a process of adjusting the parameters of a pre-trained model to adapt it to a specific task or domain.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="角色">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">Role refers to the function or position that a person or entity occupies in a particular context or system.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="提示词">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">Prompt words are specific terms or phrases used to guide the generation of text by a language model, often used in tasks such as text generation and machine translation.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-457115d05734fd03b3a9eb4cc5b5f65b</data>
</node>
<node id="模型">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">模型是研究的核心，其性能将得到显著增强，用于生成与课程相关的内容。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="微调过程">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">微调过程结合实际课程问题和解答进行调整，确保模型能够准确理解和生成与课程相关的内容。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="课程相关问题">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">课程相关问题将用于微调过程，以提升模型生成课程相关内容的准确性。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="用户界面">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">用户界面是智能问答系统的一部分，使用户能够方便地输入问题。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="课程内容">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">课程内容是智能问答系统的基础，用于构建课程语料库。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="系统评估和优化">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">系统评估和优化涉及对系统的全面测试和评估，以分析其在回答准确性、响应时间等方面的表现。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="RAG 的实现">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">RAG 的实现是改进大模型微调过程的关键，旨在提升模型的适应性和灵活性。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="智能问答系统开发">
  <data key="d0">event</data>
  <data key="d1">智能问答系统开发是本研究的重要步骤，旨在构建一个能够提供准确解答的系统。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="系统测试与迭代">
  <data key="d0">event</data>
  <data key="d1">系统测试与迭代是确保系统可靠性和实用性的关键步骤，通过测试和评估进行迭代优化。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="毕业论文写作">
  <data key="d0">event</data>
  <data key="d1">毕业论文写作是本研究的目标之一，用于系统地整理和总结研究过程中的发现和成果。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="学位论文">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">学位论文是研究过程中撰写的高质量论文，为后续的学术研究奠定基础。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="教育领域">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">教育领域是本研究的目标应用领域，旨在为教育领域提供创新的解决方案。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="大模型与 RAG 方法">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">大模型与 RAG 方法是本研究探索的结合方式，旨在推动相关技术在教育领域的创新和发展。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="实际课程">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">实际课程是微调过程中需要结合的问题和解答的来源，用于确保模型与课程相关。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="解答">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">解答是智能问答系统返回给用户的内容，需要确保其准确性和相关性。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="用户体验">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">用户体验是智能问答系统设计时考虑的重要因素，旨在提供流畅的使用体验。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="响应时间">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">响应时间是评估智能问答系统性能的一个重要指标，指系统从接收到问题到返回答案的时间。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="迭代优化">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">迭代优化是基于评估结果对系统进行的持续改进，以提高其性能。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="大语言模型">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">大语言模型是本研究中使用的预训练模型，用于生成和理解文本。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="用户测试">
  <data key="d0">event</data>
  <data key="d1">用户测试是评估智能问答系统表现的一种方法，通过用户实际使用系统来收集数据。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="问答准确率">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">问答准确率是评估智能问答系统性能的一个指标，指系统返回正确答案的比例。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="统计分析工具">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">统计分析工具用于分析用户测试中获得的数据，以评估系统的表现。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="研究假设">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">研究假设是研究过程中提出的关于系统表现的预测，用于指导后续的测试和评估。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="改进建议">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">改进建议是基于评估结果提出的，旨在提升系统的性能和用户体验。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="学术研究">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">学术研究是本研究的基础，用于提供理论基础和研究方向。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="参考框架">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">参考框架是文献分析法中使用的工具，用于组织和管理研究结果。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="实证支持">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">实证支持是通过案例研究法获得的，用于验证研究假设和探索应用效果。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="应用效果">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">应用效果是指智能问答系统在实际应用中的表现，包括准确性和用户满意度。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="挑战">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">挑战是指在实施智能问答系统时遇到的问题和困难。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="解决方案">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">解决方案是针对挑战提出的，用于克服困难并提升系统性能。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="LangChain">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">LangChain是一种用于构建智能问答系统的框架，本研究可能涉及其应用。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="ChatGLM">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">ChatGLM是一种基于GLM的大语言模型，可能用于构建智能问答系统。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="C语言课程问答系统">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">C语言课程问答系统是案例研究中的一个例子，用于展示智能问答系统的应用。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="中邮网院智能客服系统">
  <data key="d0">category</data>
  <data key="d1">中邮网院智能客服系统是案例研究中的一个例子，用于展示LLM和RAG技术的应用。</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ac001068fc7df3b11881c74da0e84540</data>
</node>
<node id="邮政研究">
